An '''ironwood tree''' is a lumber tree requiring level 80 [[Woodcutting]] to cut, granting 175 Woodcutting [[experience]] for each set of [[ironwood logs]] received.

Ironwood trees are found on [[Sunbleak Island]], requiring level 72 [[Sailing]] to access. An ironwood tree will fall after 400 ticks (4 minutes) of chopping. At 99 Woodcutting, with a [[dragon axe]], roughly 75,000 experience per hour can be gained from chopping ironwood trees. This can increase up to 100,000 experience per hour with a [[crystal felling axe]] and [[forester's ration]]s.

